  ...and the live path cannot override that either               ok
  an explicit ledger wins for flash-lite                         ok
  with nothing set at all, the default is batch                  ok
  ...and a day of that default leaves the reserve untouched      ok
  the env var crosses the subprocess boundary                    ok

