  a flash charge does not touch the flash-lite budget            ok
  the check sits immediately before the call site                ok
  and charges before sending                                     ok
  refusal is loud by default (SystemExit), not a silent downgrade ok
  --flash-fallback exists as an explicit opt-in                  ok

batch: an interrupt actually halts it
